  "description": "PF3 on a re-entry: the WHEN DFHPF3 arm at :125-127. 'COADM01C' is moved into CDEMO-TO-PROGRAM and RETURN-TO-PREV-SCREEN transfers, so USRSEC is never opened and no map is sent. In the stateless projection the XCTL at :514-517 becomes the response's nextProgram field and the client issues the follow-up call (gate G40): there is no server-side forward, no redirect and no session affinity. :513 moves ZEROS into CDEMO-PGM-CONTEXT, so the next transaction starts in its own ENTER state - the assertion that this transfer really did reset the pseudo-conversation.",
